msgid "Sorry I'm being such a burden to you, Sarah. I'm trying my best, I swear. It just seems like nothing is working out."
msgstr "Прости, что я такая обуза для тебя, Сара. Я стараюсь изо всех сил, клянусь. Просто кажется, что ничего не получается."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry Zoey, gotta go. Landlady's on my ass again. Fucking Bitch."
msgstr "Прости, Зои, пора бежать. Хозяйка снова на меня насела. Сука."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry about that. Was the only spare dildo I had."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry for being a burden."
msgstr "Прости, что я обуза."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry for staring. I think it's a really unique look!"
msgstr "Прости, что уставилась. Я думаю, это очень уникальный вид!"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry for the inconvenience!"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry for the trouble, Lio. How's the cleaning going?"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry for the wait, sir. Here's your Neon Lime!"
msgstr "Простите за ожидание, сэр. Вот ваш «Неон Лайм»!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry won't cut it! You owe us!"
msgstr "Извинениями не отделаешься! Ты нам должна!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry! Just haven't had much time to dig in. Plus I'm more of an apple girl anyways."
msgstr "Прости! Просто не было времени ими насладиться. Да и я вообще-то больше по яблокам."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry! Sorry!"
msgstr "Прости! Прости!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean to."
msgstr "Прости, я не хотела."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I-.. I changed my mind.."
msgstr "Извини, я-.. я передумала.."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry, I-... I have to go."
msgstr "Прости, я-... мне пора."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I-... I know my arm looks weird."
msgstr "Прости, я-... Я знаю, моя рука выглядит странно."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, heh. Got another challenge for ya. We're looking for another high payout run. You think you can give us another big one?"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Sorry, it's just... your... you know- It looks very... <color=#EB83FF>realistic</color>...
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, it's just... your... you know- It looks very... realistic..."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry, um... Maybe another time!"
msgstr "Извините, эм... Может в другой раз!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry-...! Didn't mean to pry."
msgstr "Прости-...! Не хотела лезть не в своё дело."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry. I'll get out of your hair."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry... I just... can't."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry... I-... I didn't mean to-..."
msgstr "Прости... Я—... Я не хотел—..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Mira"
msgid "Sorry...! I-... I didn't-... I don't-... Ahhh...!"
msgstr "Прости...! Я-... я не-... не хотела-... Ааах...!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry? Hahaha. It just makes me want you in my lap that much more."
msgstr "Прости? Хахаха. Это только заставляет меня хотеть тебя к себе на колени ещё сильнее."

